        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: Florida Board of Regents, State University System of Florida\n- Places: Florida, United States\n\nFacts:\n- From 1965 to 2001, the Florida Board of Regents was the governing body for the State University System of Florida.\n- The State University System of Florida includes all public universities in Florida, United States.\n- The State University System of Florida is a system of twelve public universities in the U.S. state of Florida.\n- The State University System of Florida is also abbreviated as SUS, or SUSF outside Florida.",
